  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A stone is projected at angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> to the horizontal. The ratio of kinetic energy of the stone at point of projection to its kinetic energy at the highest point of flight will be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "4o4NS",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DFsp3",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sAFpE",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YrmXK",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let stone is projected with initial velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e7309dd1-ed39-4229-a7af-2312617a05c4-9894893.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 87px;\" /></p><p>Kinetic energy&nbsp;of the stone at point of projection is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Now, velocity of stone at maximum height is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, so kinetic energy at that point is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
